{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13213190","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13213190","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1321319001:1":{"text":"トナカイも荷物も無事だったんだね！本当にありがとう！これでクビにならずに済むよ！","source_cn":"驯鹿没受伤，货物也没丢……！真是太感谢你们了！我总算不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF2D9C249D003306","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321319002:1":{"text":"でも、あなたの怪我は大丈夫なんですか？","source_cn":"比起这个，你腿上的伤还好吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF2B4246A9142062","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321319003:1":{"text":"さっき包帯で軽く処置したんだけど、歩くだけなら問題なさそう。","source_cn":"刚才简单包扎了一下，走路不成问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1919F55CF3055C89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321319004:1":{"text":"……おっと！早く荷物を届けないと！これ以上遅くなったら、配達手当を減らされちゃう！","source_cn":"……哎呀！我得赶快把货物送到白熊旅店去才行！要是耽误了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAED26615FB907623","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321319005:1":{"text":"ちょうど私たちも旅館に戻るところなので、よかったら一緒に行きましょう。","source_cn":"我们正好也要去白熊旅店，就一起过去吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x741C66343176EEC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title